\rho M^0\mathbf{p_{t+1}}+\frac{\tau}{2}M^1\mathbf{q_{t+1}}=\rho M^0 \mathbf{p_t}-\frac{\tau}{2}M^1\mathbf{q_t}+\frac{\tau}{2}(\mathbf{F_{t+1}+\mathbf{F_t}})
